      "summary": "APPROVED — stage 'Architecture & task plan' requires human sign-off | 1 HIGH-impact risk(s) in the design risk register",
      "rationale": "API contract and task plan look right; 302 (not 301) agreed so expiry and analytics keep working"
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-12T10:32:21.734252258Z",
      "node": "design",
      "kind": "DESIGN_CHOICE",
      "actor": "agent:design",
      "summary": "302 instead of 301 redirects",
      "rationale": "Use 302 + no-store | alternatives: [301 (cacheable, fewer requests)] | consequences: Every click reaches the service (analytics accurate, links can be disabled) at the cost of more traffic."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-12T10:32:21.734297376Z",
      "node": "design",
      "kind": "DESIGN_CHOICE",
      "actor": "agent:design",
      "summary": "Random codes instead of encoded sequence ids",
      "rationale": "7-char Base62 from SecureRandom with collision retry | alternatives: [Base62(sequence id), hash of URL] | consequences: Codes are not enumerable; needs a uniqueness check on insert."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-12T10:32:21.734327509Z",
      "node": "design",
      "kind": "DESIGN_CHOICE",
      "actor": "agent:design",
      "summary": "Asynchronous click recording",
      "rationale": "Record clicks on a bounded executor | alternatives: [Synchronous insert, Message queue] | consequences: Redirect latency unaffected; clicks may be dropped under overload (acceptable for analytics)."
    },
